Sony Camera Remote SDK
----------------------
This project contains no Sony code and redistributes no Sony binaries.

It does, however, drive a `CameraWebApp` server process that links against the
Sony Camera Remote SDK. That binary is built by the user from the alpha-sdk-api
sources, and the Sony SDK libraries it links (libCr_Core, libCr_PTP_IP,
libCr_PTP_USB and related components) are obtained directly from Sony and remain
subject to the Sony Camera Remote SDK License Agreement — they are licensed, not
sold, and are not redistributable.

Anyone building or running the camera server must obtain the Sony SDK themselves
and accept Sony's licence terms.
